  "description": "Golden State Fur Con (GSFC) is an annual furry convention in Southern California, organized by Anthropomorphic Events Incorporated, a 501(c)(3) organization. The first was held April 19 to 21, 2019, at the Hilton Irvine Orange County Airport Hotel, and since 2023 it has been held at the Hilton Los Angeles Airport. Attendance has grown from 1,230 in 2019 to nearly 1,950, and each year supports an animal charity. In 2025 the programming added a night market and a drag show and dropped the artist alley, pool toy party and fursuit parade.",
